This[ recipe] isn[�]�[t] that dish. It is tied to that spicy boxed mac[aron]i and[ cheese], that my wife introduced me to, and we would eat it together at a time that we didn[’]t[ eat] much. Also the roots are a stove top mac and[ cheese]. The kind where the only powder involved it mustard[ powder] and the spice comes from a complex sauce with a bright bals[amic flavor] and a nutty essence that pairs well with the gruy[ere] and trust me if you finish it with toasted sesame, you will[ not] regret it. Please enjoy and[ feel] free

